   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\"Preserve the recognizable pulsing bass rhythm, original kick placement,\n syncopated tom/conga figures, ticking hats and rapid rattling percussion\n fills; do not replace the source groove.\"\n\"Gradually harden the drums with metallic clanks, gritty parallel saturation,\n machine-like ghost hits, short gated reverbs and distant warehouse rumble.\"\n\"Use tension, silence and controlled drum density for a bleak mid-track\n break, then restore the same bass motif beneath a heavier, driving peak.\"",
   "originalText": "\"Preserve the recognizable pulsing bass rhythm, original kick placement,\n syncopated tom/conga figures, ticking hats and rapid rattling percussion\n fills; do not replace the source groove.\"\n\"Gradually harden the drums with metallic clanks, gritty parallel saturation,\n machine-like ghost hits, short gated reverbs and distant warehouse rumble.\"\n\"Use tension, silence and controlled drum density for a bleak mid-track\n break, then restore the same bass motif beneath a heavier, driving peak.\"",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
